  "summary": "Malicious code in @thiennq/docs-viewer (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the bun runtime and executes a bundled 727KB file (math_init.js) at install time. That file is heavily obfuscated with a custom decoder and rotated string array, and its decoded content is binary/compressed, so its behaviour is hidden from inspection. The payload is unrelated to the package's declared function (a static docs-viewer HTTP server that otherwise uses only built-in Node modules). Installing this package runs an opaque, obfuscated executable payload during install.",
